      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka gwa kashatu ogw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Belishaza, nyowe Danieli nkareeba okworekwa, okwabaire nikukurata okw'okubanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.1.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 1:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naareeba ebintu omu kworekwa. Obwo nkaba ndi omu rurembo Shushani, oruri omu ishaza rya Elamu. Omuri okwo kworekwa naareeba ndi aha mugyera Ulai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.8.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 8:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku naimukize amaisho, naareeba empaya y'entaama eyemereire aha nkungu y'omugyera. Egyo mpaya ekaba eine amahembe abiri, gombi gakaba gari maraingwa, kwonka erimwe niryeshumba erindi; kandi eriraingwa niryo ryamezire bwanyima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naareeba egyo mpaya neegyenda neeshengura busha aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba, aha bukiizi-bwa-bumohso n'obwa buryo; hakaba hatariho nyamaishwa erikubaasa kugiza omu kaso, n'obu yaakuba orikubaasa kugijuna ekintu; yaaguma neeyegirira nk'oku erikwenda, eine eigundu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
