        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi nk'oku ryacweka, omu mwanya gwaryo hakameramu agandi mahembe ana, nikwo haribaho obugabe buna oburikuruga omuri eryo ihanga; kwonka buryaba butaine maani nk'ag'ogwo mugabe w'okubanza. ",
