        },
        {
          "text": "Omu bunaku bw'aha muheru gw'obwo bugabe buna, abasiisi ku bariba baherize kushiisha bakarengyesereza, omugabe ow'ahamaisho aharikutiinisa, orikumanya ebitarikumanywa, aryaimuka. ",
